<title>POLAND: Poland cuts T-bill offer to PLN 4 bln in January.</title>
<headline>Poland cuts T-bill offer to PLN 4 bln in January.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish treasury cut its monthly offer of treasury bills to four billion zlotys in January, 1997 from 4.35 billion in December 1996, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
